entries[240623] = { ["name"] = "Tainted Matrix", ["text"] = "8 sec cast\nA tainted pylon activates and begins to channel shadowy energy into the Fallen Avatar, increasing his energy generation.\n\nThe Maiden of Valor refracts the shadowy beam to all players if she stands within it, inflicting 39512 Shadow damage to all players every 2 sec.\n\nIf a player stands between the pylon and the Fallen Avatar the beam is redirected to them. Standing within the beam inflicts 5532 Shadow damage every 1.5 sec.\n\nIn addition, the target is afflicted with Tainted Essence. This effect intensifies every 2 sec while standing within the beam." }
